const restockNotes='Small quantities can be set aside for repairs.|The supplier’s quantity is checked on arrival.|Larger purchases are priced before ordering.|A small sample is checked before a larger purchase.|A reserve is kept for repeat orders.|Deliveries are checked before being put away.|The keeper checks the quality before buying.|Bulk orders are arranged in advance.|Replacement stock is compared with the previous supply.|Orders are grouped when transport can be shared.';
